# ------------------------------------------------ use-case-only tooling ---------
# Written for the ESA use cases (thermal wildlife, wildfire, LMOD) or for
# earlier single-dataset experiments, not for the Space-Tracker benchmark. They
# read docs/use_case_results/ and dataset roots that are not part of this
# release, so they only cross-reference each other.
